                         "Summary":  "Prosecution-retained expert (criminal justice professor) analyzed the same video and argued Miu could have retreated and used disproportionate force. However, on cross-examination, the expert conceded: (1) the river environment limited practical retreat options; (2) the 40-second timeframe allowed little deliberation; (3) Wisconsin law imposes no duty to retreat when facing imminent harm. The expert\u0027s analysis was weakened by these concessions.",
